---
title: "Advanced Coding and Reimbursement"
code: "HIM-254"
category: "health-information-management"
credits: "4"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Stresses advanced coding skills through practical exercises using actual medical records. Introduces CPT-4 coding system and guidelines for out-patient/ambulatory surgery coding. Introduces prospective payment system and its integration with ICD-CM-9 coding. Lecture 4 hours per week.
